  "prefLabel": "Pes 101.26 Public health emergency",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 101.26 \"Public health emergency\" means a state of emergency declared by the commissioner when a pest borne organism has the potential for a serious impact on human health if not controlled in a timely fashion.\n\nSource. #1410.4, eff 1-10-79; amd by #2202, eff 12-6-82; ss by #2209, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss by #6239, eff 5-2-96; ss by #7544, eff 8-9-01 (formerly Pes 101.251)",
